WEBVTT

00:00:40.250 --> 00:00:43.420
<i>-You're strange.</i>
<i>-You almost could have killed me.</i>

00:00:43.510 --> 00:00:44.720
<i>Let's play again.</i>

00:00:44.800 --> 00:00:46.550
<i>Next time with Misha, too!</i>

00:00:54.100 --> 00:00:55.140
Why did you hesitate?

00:00:59.060 --> 00:01:01.690
You're a Sirius?

00:01:05.530 --> 00:01:06.490
I'm Yuliy Jirov.

00:01:09.990 --> 00:01:13.500
What is Alexei's son doing here
after all this time?

00:03:05.270 --> 00:03:06.690
<i>A village that's not on a map.</i>

00:03:07.530 --> 00:03:09.280
I wonder what kind of place it is.

00:03:09.360 --> 00:03:11.410
The last thing I want is to sleep outside.

00:03:11.740 --> 00:03:14.990
If you pay,
you can come to my house anytime.

00:03:15.200 --> 00:03:18.290
Why would I want to go to a place
with more people like you?

00:03:18.370 --> 00:03:20.460
Now, now. Don't be shy.

00:03:20.540 --> 00:03:21.870
-Stop it.
-My little brothers

00:03:21.960 --> 00:03:24.130
-who jump around like your hair
-Don't touch.

00:03:24.210 --> 00:03:26.920
-will soothe your heart...
-How many times do I have to tell you?

00:03:27.210 --> 00:03:29.380
We'll soon arrive, but what's next?

00:03:30.130 --> 00:03:32.090
I've chartered a plane in the next town.

00:03:33.260 --> 00:03:35.390
Are those the ancient documents of Sirius?

00:03:36.300 --> 00:03:38.560
Yeah, it's a copy but...

00:03:39.640 --> 00:03:41.850
I didn't think I'd see it again.

00:03:44.520 --> 00:03:46.860
I wonder how Yuliy is doing now.

00:03:47.820 --> 00:03:50.650
If he was told we were going to Dogville
from the beginning,

00:03:50.740 --> 00:03:52.900
he wouldn't have went off on his own.

00:03:53.610 --> 00:03:54.910
I don't know about that.

00:03:55.740 --> 00:04:00.370
He's trying to find another way besides
killing Vampires, this time on his own...

00:04:00.620 --> 00:04:03.370
Wherever his destination had been,
he would've gone alone.

00:04:03.460 --> 00:04:05.130
And he will certainly find it...

00:04:06.000 --> 00:04:09.840
If I can help him
in the best way I can, then that's...

00:04:10.710 --> 00:04:14.380
You two are like
an awkward father and son.

00:04:15.010 --> 00:04:17.510
Parents wish
for their children's happiness.

00:04:18.050 --> 00:04:18.970
But I...

00:04:19.510 --> 00:04:22.930
It's not like
you wanted to make him unhappy.

00:04:25.150 --> 00:04:29.570
Right now, you're doing the same thing.
I think Yuliy knows it, too.

00:04:31.610 --> 00:04:32.820
I hope so.

00:04:35.360 --> 00:04:36.320
Please wait.

00:04:37.070 --> 00:04:37.910
Father...

00:04:38.620 --> 00:04:40.080
Do you know Father?

00:04:40.990 --> 00:04:43.120
Don't come in. Leave at once!

00:04:44.210 --> 00:04:45.210
Hey, old man.

00:04:45.670 --> 00:04:49.340
If he and I weren't there,
the Vampires would've gotten you by now.

00:04:49.920 --> 00:04:50.750
Vampire...

00:04:54.090 --> 00:04:56.180
I see. That was a Vampire...

00:05:00.220 --> 00:05:03.060
I can imagine why you're here.

00:05:03.890 --> 00:05:05.390
The Ark of Sirius, right?

00:05:07.400 --> 00:05:09.610
-What do you know about the Ark...
-Give it up.

00:05:10.400 --> 00:05:11.940
How much do you know about it?

00:05:12.820 --> 00:05:13.820
Please tell me!

00:05:20.370 --> 00:05:24.580
I was going around the world
for a long time looking for the Ark...

00:05:25.620 --> 00:05:28.290
I met Alexei then.

00:05:29.210 --> 00:05:31.630
When I learned that he was a Sirius
I was surprised,

00:05:32.130 --> 00:05:35.340
but he invited me to the village
with open arms...

00:05:36.550 --> 00:05:37.930
I met the family, too.

00:05:38.640 --> 00:05:41.560
I bet you don't remember
because you were a child.

00:05:42.390 --> 00:05:44.430
Have you seen the Ark?

00:05:45.180 --> 00:05:46.020
No,

00:05:46.100 --> 00:05:50.150
he disappeared suddenly without a word...

00:05:50.770 --> 00:05:51.860
Along with the Ark.

00:05:52.690 --> 00:05:54.610
I desperately chased after him.

00:05:55.110 --> 00:05:57.990
And finally here at Sakhalin, he...

00:05:58.860 --> 00:06:00.070
Is Father alive!?

00:06:01.240 --> 00:06:03.620
You saw him, right? Where is Father now?

00:06:03.790 --> 00:06:05.790
-Certainly the Ark is there...
-It's no use.

00:06:06.960 --> 00:06:08.790
You won't get your hands
on the Ark anyway.

00:06:09.370 --> 00:06:11.330
Alexei made it so.

00:06:12.540 --> 00:06:13.550
Then,

00:06:14.710 --> 00:06:17.260
at least until the day I die...

00:06:19.130 --> 00:06:20.010
What does that--

00:06:21.300 --> 00:06:22.800
That's all I have to say.

00:06:24.720 --> 00:06:25.560
Go home.

00:06:37.610 --> 00:06:38.860
We survived thanks to you.

00:06:39.610 --> 00:06:41.820
We'll back down for today.

00:06:42.660 --> 00:06:43.660
I'm hungry, too.

00:06:44.370 --> 00:06:47.080
But if he stays there,
they would come attacking again.

00:06:48.120 --> 00:06:49.620
Something doesn't make sense.

00:06:50.790 --> 00:06:53.670
Why did the Vampires
attack the old man anyway?

00:06:54.630 --> 00:06:56.550
They wanted to know where the Ark was.

00:06:56.630 --> 00:06:59.630
They came to Sakhalin on information
from the ancient document.

00:07:00.340 --> 00:07:02.340
They've known where it is for a long time.

00:07:02.800 --> 00:07:05.720
They wanted to silence him,
so the information wouldn't leak?

00:07:06.140 --> 00:07:07.930
That's what's odd.

00:07:08.310 --> 00:07:11.730
Those kids could've killed
that old man sooner, right?

00:07:12.400 --> 00:07:16.860
Then are you saying he was kept alive
on purpose until we arrived?

00:07:17.280 --> 00:07:20.740
Yeah, maybe their target was you
from the beginning.

00:07:21.150 --> 00:07:21.990
Me?

00:07:22.070 --> 00:07:24.200
It was as if they didn't see me.

00:07:24.740 --> 00:07:26.240
What on earth for?

00:07:27.120 --> 00:07:27.950
Who knows?

00:07:28.700 --> 00:07:31.250
But it's certain
they are closer to the Ark.

00:07:32.120 --> 00:07:33.880
We should hurry, too,

00:07:34.830 --> 00:07:35.920
but our last hope is...

00:07:39.380 --> 00:07:43.890
<i>What on earth did Father do here</i>
<i>in Sakhalin?</i>

00:07:52.270 --> 00:07:53.560
That guy jumped out,

00:07:53.650 --> 00:07:55.520
and Tamara was scared!

00:07:55.610 --> 00:07:57.150
Stop it! It's not like that.

00:07:58.570 --> 00:07:59.400
Geez.

00:07:59.730 --> 00:08:02.450
How are you feeling, Mikhail?

00:08:02.780 --> 00:08:03.820
The worst.

00:08:04.450 --> 00:08:05.950
Because I saw your face.

00:08:06.280 --> 00:08:10.330
-Misha's in a bad mood.
-He's behaving like a baby to Master Yev.

00:08:10.410 --> 00:08:12.250
He needs a punishment, a punishment!

00:08:12.830 --> 00:08:15.460
That's fine... Now Tamara,

00:08:15.790 --> 00:08:17.340
Yuliy, was it?

00:08:18.000 --> 00:08:20.380
Yeah! So he's called Yuliy.

00:08:20.550 --> 00:08:21.510
Misha's brother.

00:08:22.010 --> 00:08:22.920
-Yuliy!
-Yuliy!

00:08:23.380 --> 00:08:24.260
You saw him?

00:08:24.630 --> 00:08:27.350
Yes, and we promised to play again.

00:08:27.600 --> 00:08:29.350
Told him we'll invite Misha, too.

00:08:30.520 --> 00:08:32.060
<i>Yuliy is in Sakhalin...</i>

00:08:32.390 --> 00:08:35.900
Then the next time you see him,
I'll go, too.

00:08:36.560 --> 00:08:37.940
-Really!?
-Really!?

00:08:38.020 --> 00:08:40.110
The place... Let's see...

00:08:40.780 --> 00:08:43.530
How about the Sirius' sacred place?

00:08:44.070 --> 00:08:45.570
Surely not the seal...

00:08:46.740 --> 00:08:49.120
What a valiant little brother.

00:08:49.580 --> 00:08:54.960
Fulfilling the role
for his useless big brother.

00:08:57.960 --> 00:09:00.550
We'll think about
how to make the old man talk.

00:09:01.210 --> 00:09:02.710
So first, we eat.

00:09:03.260 --> 00:09:04.840
Oh, this is the place.

00:09:05.510 --> 00:09:07.090
I heard at the port this place

00:09:07.180 --> 00:09:09.800
is rumored to be the best
in southern Sakhalin.

00:09:11.640 --> 00:09:12.970
Oh? You are...

00:09:14.100 --> 00:09:15.020
Yuliy!

00:09:15.190 --> 00:09:17.270
Oh. A friend?

00:09:18.400 --> 00:09:19.230
<i>Is she?</i>

00:09:28.950 --> 00:09:33.540
I almost ran into my father at the port,
so when I saw the major by coincidence,

00:09:33.620 --> 00:09:36.080
I ran and jumped onboard
the same ship in haste...

00:09:36.160 --> 00:09:38.960
I thought he must be chasing the Jaegers.

00:09:39.040 --> 00:09:41.800
But unbelievably, we arrived in Sakhalin!

00:09:42.210 --> 00:09:44.840
I thought I would faint then.

00:09:44.920 --> 00:09:47.130
You made the mistake all on your own.

00:09:47.430 --> 00:09:51.640
But it was worth the mistake
being able to see you like this, Yuliy!

00:09:53.390 --> 00:09:54.220
However,

00:09:54.970 --> 00:09:58.690
it's unbelievable that the captain
is still alive and is here in Sakhalin, too.

00:09:59.440 --> 00:10:01.270
Certainly, there is a resemblance.

00:10:01.480 --> 00:10:04.030
I can't believe
the Japanese army was looking for it...

00:10:04.110 --> 00:10:05.320
Not only Japan.

00:10:05.990 --> 00:10:09.200
The western powers are also looking
for the Ark in secret apparently.

00:10:09.740 --> 00:10:10.620
The Ark?

00:10:10.820 --> 00:10:13.700
Father was afraid that would happen,
so he took the Ark and...

00:10:14.240 --> 00:10:15.080
Father?

00:10:15.910 --> 00:10:16.750
I see.

00:10:17.160 --> 00:10:19.750
Why did the professor talk to you?

00:10:20.290 --> 00:10:22.460
Well, we owed each other.

00:10:23.090 --> 00:10:26.010
Um... Yuliy's father?

00:10:26.090 --> 00:10:28.590
Did he come to Sakhalin, too?

00:10:28.800 --> 00:10:30.220
It seems so,

00:10:30.300 --> 00:10:34.930
but that gentle guy's senior
won't quite talk about what he knows.

00:10:35.390 --> 00:10:36.220
I see.

00:10:36.720 --> 00:10:38.640
Then can I go and see him, too?

00:10:39.600 --> 00:10:43.190
There's much I want to ask him
as his junior of the army.

00:10:43.730 --> 00:10:44.820
Sounds fine to me.

00:10:47.190 --> 00:10:48.950
I don't know
the captain's intentions,

00:10:49.360 --> 00:10:51.700
but I don't want you to be
too cautious of me...

00:10:52.410 --> 00:10:55.080
Yes, it's true that I came here
by orders of the Army...

00:10:55.910 --> 00:10:59.160
But whether or not the Ark
is truly necessary for our country,

00:11:00.250 --> 00:11:03.330
I'll decide after seeing it
with my own eyes.

00:11:04.630 --> 00:11:06.210
The Ark belongs to Sirius.

00:11:07.340 --> 00:11:09.010
Um...

00:11:20.020 --> 00:11:20.940
Are you all right?

00:11:22.520 --> 00:11:23.350
Why?

00:11:24.020 --> 00:11:26.070
Yuliy, you're sensitive to the cold.

00:11:28.190 --> 00:11:29.240
Your father...

00:11:31.530 --> 00:11:32.950
I hope you get to see him.

00:11:36.660 --> 00:11:40.620
But when I really think about it, I don't
know what to say even if I see him.

00:11:41.080 --> 00:11:42.580
I don't even remember his face.

00:11:45.670 --> 00:11:47.210
What's a father like?

00:11:49.630 --> 00:11:51.880
Um... Let's see.

00:11:52.220 --> 00:11:54.220
In my father's case,

00:11:54.300 --> 00:11:56.640
he's very stubborn, nagging,

00:11:56.720 --> 00:11:59.720
doesn't understand me at all,

00:11:59.810 --> 00:12:01.310
um, and...

00:12:01.890 --> 00:12:02.730
And?

00:12:05.480 --> 00:12:08.690
-I'm sorry, that's about it.
-I see.

00:12:09.730 --> 00:12:15.450
But that's his way
of thinking dearly of me,

00:12:16.030 --> 00:12:19.740
and I think maybe it's because
he's desperately trying to protect me.

00:12:20.830 --> 00:12:22.960
Protecting the family he loves...

00:12:23.290 --> 00:12:26.250
Being able to protect us
is his pride I think.

00:12:26.960 --> 00:12:28.460
So that's a father.

00:12:30.420 --> 00:12:34.180
But maybe that's just my wishful thinking.

00:12:35.090 --> 00:12:35.930
Brother...

00:12:37.100 --> 00:12:38.970
Maybe it was the same for my brother.

00:12:40.010 --> 00:12:43.850
As a Sirius,
protecting me and Mother was his pride.

00:12:45.060 --> 00:12:48.980
That's why he taught me
how to hunt and protect myself.

00:12:50.980 --> 00:12:54.650
So your brother took your father's place.

00:12:55.450 --> 00:12:56.280
Yeah.

00:12:57.410 --> 00:12:58.240
But...

00:12:59.530 --> 00:13:01.540
What I learned from brother,

00:13:02.160 --> 00:13:03.960
he learned from Father.

00:13:04.830 --> 00:13:06.750
My brother learned about Sirius pride

00:13:07.460 --> 00:13:08.750
and what we must protect,

00:13:09.960 --> 00:13:12.090
all from the father I don't know.

00:13:13.130 --> 00:13:16.380
<i>So what Father did must be...</i>

00:13:21.720 --> 00:13:23.140
Misha.

00:13:24.100 --> 00:13:25.940
Where are you going at this hour?

00:13:27.190 --> 00:13:28.650
It's none of your business.

00:13:29.110 --> 00:13:33.110
Were you going to
warn your dear little brother?

00:13:34.110 --> 00:13:37.030
Were you going to tell him
"Don't go near the Ark"?

00:13:56.170 --> 00:13:57.840
<i>It's the Slave from that time...</i>

00:13:59.050 --> 00:14:01.600
Yuck, that's dirty.

00:14:01.930 --> 00:14:05.350
The dark sea of death
spreads through our tribe.

00:14:05.980 --> 00:14:07.310
Put him out of his misery.

00:14:07.390 --> 00:14:09.400
-What?
-What? My clothes will get dirty!

00:14:09.480 --> 00:14:11.480
Tamara, he's your kind!

00:14:11.560 --> 00:14:12.400
Do something.

00:14:12.610 --> 00:14:16.610
What? No, I don't want to.
Here, you kill yourself.

00:14:18.030 --> 00:14:19.780
Hurry.

00:14:19.990 --> 00:14:24.540
Die. Die!

00:14:26.370 --> 00:14:27.210
Oh?

00:14:44.470 --> 00:14:45.520
Pitiful.

00:14:46.180 --> 00:14:48.600
There may be
more than one infected onboard.

00:14:49.230 --> 00:14:52.440
I'll leave it up to you.
Mikhail,

00:14:53.230 --> 00:14:55.400
if you don't want to be like this,

00:14:55.480 --> 00:14:57.820
be a good boy until the time comes.

00:14:58.400 --> 00:14:59.900
Come on, do a better job.

00:14:59.990 --> 00:15:02.740
I wonder why he didn't listen to me.

00:15:02.950 --> 00:15:04.160
<i>What on earth was that?</i>

00:15:11.500 --> 00:15:13.420
Being a major so young.

00:15:14.090 --> 00:15:16.250
You must be quite good.

00:15:16.880 --> 00:15:17.920
I'm very grateful.

00:15:18.300 --> 00:15:21.220
But you had no luck taking over my post.

00:15:21.680 --> 00:15:24.930
It's almost as if you can have no hope
for a successful career now.

00:15:25.640 --> 00:15:27.930
You're still considered missing.

00:15:28.640 --> 00:15:30.730
Your post in the army
has not been revoked.

00:15:31.480 --> 00:15:32.980
As long as you obtain the Ark,

00:15:33.350 --> 00:15:35.900
-you can go back to Japan with dignity...
-Of course I know that.

00:15:36.320 --> 00:15:38.820
I'm here because I can't report back.

00:15:39.740 --> 00:15:40.570
Why?

00:15:41.280 --> 00:15:43.700
You already know the location of the Ark,
don't you?

00:15:46.580 --> 00:15:49.250
Even if I knew,
nothing can be done about it anymore.

00:15:50.330 --> 00:15:51.160
I see.

00:15:51.790 --> 00:15:57.210
Then to find out what that means,
could you tell me where the Ark is?

00:15:58.590 --> 00:16:02.340
I'll check with my own eyes
why it's impossible to obtain it

00:16:02.430 --> 00:16:04.390
and report the details
to high-ranking officials.

00:16:05.390 --> 00:16:09.390
If I can convince them with what I report,
we shall be released from our mission.

00:16:11.180 --> 00:16:14.480
You could have done so yourself,
but you didn't.

00:16:15.940 --> 00:16:19.280
-There's another reason, isn't there?
-No! I won't say it.

00:16:19.940 --> 00:16:22.280
I promised Alexei.

00:16:23.320 --> 00:16:24.160
A promise?

00:16:24.780 --> 00:16:26.450
So you did see Father.

00:16:27.030 --> 00:16:27.950
What promise?

00:16:28.200 --> 00:16:29.040
Can't say...

00:16:30.040 --> 00:16:31.330
-I can't say!
-Old man!

00:16:31.410 --> 00:16:34.540
Shut up!
You're better off not knowing anything.

00:16:34.620 --> 00:16:36.330
Just go on back to your village!

00:16:38.170 --> 00:16:39.000
I can't go home.

00:16:39.880 --> 00:16:40.710
The village,

00:16:41.460 --> 00:16:42.300
Dogville is...

00:16:43.420 --> 00:16:44.430
Is gone now.

00:16:46.090 --> 00:16:50.010
10 years ago, it was attacked by Vampires
because they were after the Ark...

00:16:51.600 --> 00:16:52.600
Everyone died.

00:16:53.560 --> 00:16:54.390
Everyone...

00:16:55.480 --> 00:16:57.190
How can it be?

00:16:57.480 --> 00:16:58.480
Then what did he...

00:16:59.520 --> 00:17:01.730
Then what did Alexei do it for?

00:17:03.190 --> 00:17:05.610
I am the only Sirius survivor.

00:17:06.490 --> 00:17:09.700
As a survivor, I have to know.

00:17:10.790 --> 00:17:12.910
Why did Father take the Ark?

00:17:13.700 --> 00:17:15.290
What was he going to do with it?

00:17:16.210 --> 00:17:18.420
Why did he come here to Sakhalin?

00:17:19.630 --> 00:17:21.880
The Vampires are still after the Ark, too.

00:17:22.630 --> 00:17:25.300
It's a matter of time
for them to reach where Father is.

00:17:26.220 --> 00:17:27.640
Maybe they're already there...

00:17:28.930 --> 00:17:32.350
That's why I have to get there
as soon as possible.

00:17:33.020 --> 00:17:35.940
To protect Father and the Ark from them!

00:17:38.520 --> 00:17:40.270
So please, old man...

00:17:46.610 --> 00:17:48.200
-Alexei...
-Huh?

00:17:54.120 --> 00:17:57.710
If I knew he would do such a thing,

00:17:58.370 --> 00:17:59.460
I would have...

00:18:00.210 --> 00:18:01.040
What do you mean?

00:18:02.380 --> 00:18:05.920
He sealed it deep underneath
the mountains of Sakhalin

00:18:06.010 --> 00:18:08.180
so that nobody could get a hold
of the Ark.

00:18:09.590 --> 00:18:12.010
I don’t even know if he’s still alive.

00:18:13.100 --> 00:18:14.520
But when I touched it,

00:18:15.220 --> 00:18:16.310
I heard his voice...

00:18:17.440 --> 00:18:22.060
"Never come again,
and tell no one," he said.

00:18:22.770 --> 00:18:25.280
That's the promise you made with Father?

00:18:27.280 --> 00:18:32.070
But even then,
I couldn't just leave him there like that.

00:18:32.580 --> 00:18:34.450
So here in Sakhalin, I must at least...

00:18:36.200 --> 00:18:37.040
Thank you.

00:18:38.750 --> 00:18:41.250
You were fond of my father.

00:18:42.420 --> 00:18:44.210
You even gave up going back to Japan

00:18:44.750 --> 00:18:46.420
and stayed by his side all along.

00:18:47.880 --> 00:18:49.010
So thank you for that.

00:18:49.680 --> 00:18:53.050
For still considering Father as a friend.

00:18:53.930 --> 00:18:54.890
A friend?

00:18:59.140 --> 00:19:01.600
I see. That's right.

00:19:02.440 --> 00:19:06.230
Since then, he and I have always been...

00:19:16.910 --> 00:19:19.000
Father and the Ark are here?

00:19:20.750 --> 00:19:22.960
I want you to have this, too.

00:19:24.130 --> 00:19:24.960
This is...

00:19:25.420 --> 00:19:28.510
I felt as if I were talking to Alexei

00:19:28.590 --> 00:19:31.550
when I was talking to you...

00:19:33.680 --> 00:19:34.510
<i>Father.</i>

00:19:37.470 --> 00:19:40.060
<i>I couldn't help him,</i>

00:19:40.890 --> 00:19:42.850
<i>but maybe as his son, you can...</i>

00:19:43.850 --> 00:19:44.690
<i>So please...</i>

00:19:45.690 --> 00:19:47.110
<i>Please help Alexei!</i>

00:19:48.780 --> 00:19:50.440
<i>Yes. Certainly.</i>

00:19:55.320 --> 00:19:56.410
Dogville.

00:19:58.160 --> 00:20:00.290
So this is where Yuliy was born.

00:20:01.210 --> 00:20:03.210
At a place like this...

00:20:03.830 --> 00:20:05.580
It's no wonder nobody could find it.

00:20:07.040 --> 00:20:10.670
If it is as the ancient documents say,
what we came for should be right here.

00:20:11.590 --> 00:20:13.720
Now, shall we split up into two groups?

00:20:14.090 --> 00:20:14.930
Why?

00:20:16.850 --> 00:20:17.970
We have to bury them.

00:20:18.760 --> 00:20:21.100
OK, leave the heavy labor up to me.

00:20:21.560 --> 00:20:22.390
Oh?

00:20:22.940 --> 00:20:24.650
Fine, I'll do it!

00:20:26.270 --> 00:20:27.110
I'm sorry.

00:20:36.370 --> 00:20:37.410
<i>Britain, huh...</i>

00:20:38.700 --> 00:20:40.160
I can't let my guard down...

00:20:41.080 --> 00:20:42.540
<i>Major, Major!</i>

00:20:42.750 --> 00:20:44.710
Major, please wake up.

00:20:45.750 --> 00:20:48.130
Well, you're awfully energetic
for the morning.

00:20:48.340 --> 00:20:50.550
Wait till you see me
after I have breakfast...

00:20:50.840 --> 00:20:53.840
Never mind that! Yuliy isn't here!

00:20:54.050 --> 00:20:56.090
The car is gone, so probably Bishop,
too...

00:20:57.470 --> 00:20:58.890
Wha... What shall we do?

00:21:00.260 --> 00:21:01.470
Go after them, of course.

00:21:01.560 --> 00:21:03.980
But how are we going to
when we don't have the map?

00:21:04.560 --> 00:21:07.480
I memorized the approximate location
when I saw it yesterday.

00:21:08.060 --> 00:21:09.900
Of course, you're an Imperial soldier!

00:21:13.070 --> 00:21:15.110
Are you sure
about leaving those two behind?

00:21:15.740 --> 00:21:17.700
Isn't it better to have more fighters?

00:21:18.570 --> 00:21:20.030
You and I are enough.

00:21:20.700 --> 00:21:23.950
It's an honor to be relied on,
but I'm worried.

00:21:25.000 --> 00:21:28.460
You weren't able to
kill those kid Royals last time...

00:21:30.340 --> 00:21:33.170
Don't tell me you showed them mercy...

00:21:33.710 --> 00:21:35.720
It's not like that. I only...

00:21:37.930 --> 00:21:39.600
I only didn't like those eyes.

00:21:42.310 --> 00:21:44.680
Well, I don't get it,

00:21:45.230 --> 00:21:46.770
but do a better job next time.

00:21:47.770 --> 00:21:48.600
Yeah.

00:23:27.240 --> 00:23:30.080
Our destination is straight ahead,
across that ridge.

00:23:34.630 --> 00:23:35.460
What is it?

00:23:47.930 --> 00:23:50.350
I found you!

00:24:02.570 --> 00:24:03.700
<i>My name is Klarwein!</i>

00:24:03.780 --> 00:24:06.030
<i>-So the true sanctuary is...</i>
<i>-I feel a really strong</i>

00:24:06.120 --> 00:24:08.200
<i>-bad vibe...</i>
<i>-Live solitarily with the Ark.</i>

00:24:08.290 --> 00:24:12.080
<i>I need to know everything.</i>
<i>Isn't that right? Father!</i>

00:24:22.010 --> 00:24:25.010
Subtitle translation by Haruna Saito
